1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Start: double-click START.bat (first run may install).

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Check HUD: Mode must be CURSOR (press m to toggle).

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Move your index fingertip to move the cursor.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Too slow? Press ] to speed up. Constrained? Press c to calibrate.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Quick tap = click. Two quick taps = double click.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Drag: tap and hold low, move to drag, lift to drop.

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Scroll: middle finger up, move hand up/down. Press q to quit.

